# CSS Styling Skill

## Instructions

When writing CSS:

### 1. Modern CSS Reset

```css
*, *::before, *::after {
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

* {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
}

html {
  -webkit-text-size-adjust: none;
  text-size-adjust: none;
}

body {
  min-height: 100vh;
  line-height: 1.5;
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
}

img, picture, video, canvas, svg {
  display: block;
  max-width: 100%;
}

input, button, textarea, select {
  font: inherit;
}

p, h1, h2, h3, h4, h5, h6 {
  overflow-wrap: break-word;
}
```

### 2. CSS Custom Properties (Variables)

```css
:root {
  /* Colors */
  --color-primary: #2563eb;
  --color-primary-dark: #1d4ed8;
  --color-secondary: #64748b;
  --color-success: #22c55e;
  --color-error: #ef4444;

  /* Typography */
  --font-sans: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
  --font-mono: ui-monospace, monospace;

  --text-xs: 0.75rem;
  --text-sm: 0.875rem;
  --text-base: 1rem;
  --text-lg: 1.125rem;
  --text-xl: 1.25rem;
  --text-2xl: 1.5rem;
  --text-3xl: 1.875rem;

  /* Spacing */
  --space-1: 0.25rem;
  --space-2: 0.5rem;
  --space-3: 0.75rem;
  --space-4: 1rem;
  --space-6: 1.5rem;
  --space-8: 2rem;
  --space-12: 3rem;
  --space-16: 4rem;

  /* Borders */
  --radius-sm: 0.25rem;
  --radius-md: 0.375rem;
  --radius-lg: 0.5rem;
  --radius-full: 9999px;

  /* Shadows */
  --shadow-sm: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
  --shadow-md: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
  --shadow-lg: 0 10px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);

  /* Transitions */
  --transition-fast: 150ms ease;
  --transition-normal: 300ms ease;
}

/* Dark mode */
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  :root {
    --color-bg: #0f172a;
    --color-text: #f1f5f9;
  }
}
```

